  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kabeywa (KUCOFA) Coffee Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee, Beneficiaries: 538 coffee farmers, Summary: With support from USADF, KUCOFA hopes to improve financial and management systems, invest in modern coffee post-harvest equipment, facilitate the distribution of inputs to farmers, and obtain international certification(s) that will make their coffee more competitive in the market.</narrative>
  </description>
